+# Research OS — Mission Control Phase 4C
+
+## Purpose
+
+Project the existing `UnifiedToolCatalog`, `ToolHealthMatrix`, and
+`ToolHealthGate` into a bounded, read-only Mission Control capability panel
+contract.
+
+## Contract
+
+`MissionControlCapabilities.snapshot(limit=25)` returns a stable schema,
+owner identity, read-only state, existing authority declarations, health
+counts, readiness-gate data, deterministic rows, and explicit truncation.
+
+The projection is bounded to a maximum of 100 rows.
+
+## Safety
+
+This panel is observational only. It does not execute, register, unregister,
+authorize, approve, mutate catalog state, invoke MCP, or invoke Computer Use.
+It consumes the existing runtime health surfaces without creating another
+execution authority.
+
+## Next increment
+
+Bind this schema into the desktop shell as a read-only capability/tool-health
+panel. UI rendering must not gain direct mutation or execution authority.
